---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/city.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cleaning Jobs in West Auckland | Apply Once, Work Close to Home"
  description="Apply once for cleaning jobs in West Auckland. We’re based in Westgate. Suitable applicants complete Spruce onboarding and are considered for work out west."
  path="/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/"
  ogTitle="Cleaning Jobs in West Auckland | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  ogDescription="Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work in West Auckland. We are based in Westgate."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Cleaning Jobs in West Auckland | Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "description": "Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work in West Auckland. Cleaning Jobs is based in Westgate; suitable applicants are considered for residential, commercial, and specialist work allocation.",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/#webpage",
    "datePublished": "2026-08-22",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-23",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/#breadcrumb" }
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Cleaning jobs in Auckland", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-auckland/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "West Auckland", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/#faq",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "about": {
      "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization"
    },
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you cover Kumeu and the northwest?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, applications from the northwest are welcome, including Kumeu, Huapai, Whenuapai, and Riverhead. Apply with your location and transport and we'll know which areas you can realistically cover."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Where exactly are you based?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Unit 54/11 Northside Drive, Westgate, Auckland 0814. Cleaning Jobs recruits and certifies; cleaning services are delivered through The Spruce Company."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is West Auckland work guaranteed if I apply?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. Work is not guaranteed anywhere. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification. Applying puts you in the pool for consideration when suitable work comes up."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <div class="wrap">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">West Auckland</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">West Auckland</span>
        <h1>Cleaning jobs in West Auckland.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Looking for cleaning jobs in West Auckland? Apply once to be considered for Spruce-standard cleaning work out west. This is our home patch: Cleaning Jobs and The Spruce Company are based in Westgate.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reliable-split">
          <div class="reliable-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Out west</span>
            <h2>Cleaning work close to home.</h2>
            <p class="callout">We&rsquo;re based in Westgate.</p>
            <p>Cleaning Jobs runs from Northside Drive in Westgate, so applications from the western suburbs land close to home. Where you can be considered depends on the areas you can reach and the work types you suit, so we ask about your location and transport when you apply.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tick-panel">
            <div class="tick-list">
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Henderson, Te At&#257;t&#363; and Massey</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Westgate, West Harbour and Hobsonville</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">New Lynn, Avondale and Blockhouse Bay</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Glen Eden, Kelston, Green Bay and Titirangi</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Kumeu, Huapai, Riverhead and the northwest</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="suburb-note">
          <p><strong>Spruce works across the western suburbs above,</strong> plus Whenuapai in the northwest. Tell us where you are based and the areas you can realistically reach when you apply.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Work types</span>
          <h2>The cleaning work you could be allocated out west</h2>
          <p>The mix depends on demand in your part of the west. Suitable Spruce-certified cleaners are considered for three broad areas of work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="types-groups">
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Homes</span>
            <h3>Residential cleaning</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Regular and one-off home cleans across the western suburbs, plus end-of-tenancy work.</p>
            <ul><li>Residential cleaning</li><li>Deep cleaning</li><li>End of tenancy</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Business</span>
            <h3>Office &amp; commercial</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Scheduled cleans for offices, retail, and commercial sites in the west and across the wider region.</p>
            <ul><li>Office cleaning</li><li>Commercial cleaning</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Specialist</span>
            <h3>Trades-adjacent &amp; add-on</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Builders&rsquo; and handover cleans, carpet and upholstery support, and window cleaning support.</p>
            <ul><li>Builders &amp; handover cleans</li><li>Carpet &amp; upholstery support</li><li>Window cleaning support</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="types-note">
          Not every work type is available in every part of the west. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="why-split">
          <div class="why-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Why apply here</span>
            <h2>One application for cleaning work out west.</h2>
            <p>Rather than chasing roles suburb by suburb, you apply once and we keep your details on file. Suitable applicants are considered for work as demand comes up.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-panel">
            <div class="why-rows">
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">01</span><div><h3>One place to apply</h3><p>Apply once for cleaning work out west instead of role by role.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">02</span><div><h3>Based in Westgate</h3><p>Our office is on Northside Drive, in the middle of the area this page covers.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">03</span><div><h3>Matched to your area</h3><p>Considered for work based on where you are, demand, availability, and certification.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Apply for cleaning work in West Auckland.</h2>
        <p>Tell us your suburb, experience, transport, and the type of cleaning work you suit. We&rsquo;ll review your application and contact you if there&rsquo;s a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block faq-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">West Auckland questions</span>
          <h2>Applying out west</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you cover Kumeu and the northwest?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes, applications from the northwest are welcome, including Kumeu, Huapai, Whenuapai, and Riverhead. Apply with your location and transport and we&rsquo;ll know which areas you can realistically cover.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Where exactly are you based?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Unit 54/11 Northside Drive, Westgate, Auckland 0814. Cleaning Jobs recruits and certifies; cleaning services are delivered through The Spruce Company.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is West Auckland work guaranteed if I apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No. Work is not guaranteed anywhere. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification. Applying puts you in the pool for consideration when suitable work comes up.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</span>
          <h2>More ways into cleaning work</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="related-links">
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/">Cleaning jobs on the North Shore</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-central-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Central Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-south-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in South Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/">No experience? Start here</a>
          <a href="/part-time-cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Part-time cleaning jobs</a>
          <a href="/how-to-become-a-cleaner/">How to become a cleaner in NZ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
